<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Webp on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/webp/</link><description>Recent content in Webp on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2019 10:35:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/webp/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Use Nginx and mod_pagespeed to Convert Images to WebP on the Fly</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2019/20191007-serve-webp-on-the-fly-with-nginx-and-mod_pagespeed/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2019 10:35:22 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2019/20191007-serve-webp-on-the-fly-with-nginx-and-mod_pagespeed/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://nova.moe/serve-webp-on-the-fly-with-nginx-and-mod_pagespeed/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Use Nginx and mod_pagespeed to Convert Images to WebP on the Fly&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id="compile-ngx_pagespeed"&gt;Compile ngx_pagespeed&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First make sure Nginx is built with &lt;code&gt;--with-compat&lt;/code&gt;, so we do not need to rebuild Nginx from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;incubator: &lt;a href="https://github.com/apache/incubator-pagespeed-ngx.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-pagespeed-ngx.git&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-58c1ad56e8d5db27109149b50bb2f202-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Switch to the nginx source directory and configure the build&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./configure --with-compat --add-dynamic-module&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;../incubator-pagespeed-ngx
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Build modules&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;make modules
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Copy the built module into the nginx modules directory&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo cp objs/ngx_pagespeed.so /etc/nginx/modules/
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Create the cache directory for converted images&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo mkdir -p /var/ngx_pagespeed_cache
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo chown -R www-data:www-data /var/ngx_pagespeed_cache
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# Switch to the nginx source directory and configure the build\n./configure --with-compat --add-dynamic-module=../incubator-pagespeed-ngx\n\n# Build modules\nmake modules\n\n# Copy the built module into the nginx modules directory\nsudo cp objs/ngx_pagespeed.so /etc/nginx/modules/\n\n# Create the cache directory for converted images\nsudo mkdir -p /var/ngx_pagespeed_cache\nsudo chown -R www-data:www-data /var/ngx_pagespeed_cache\n","title":"shell"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-58c1ad56e8d5db27109149b50bb2f202-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-nginx" data-lang="nginx"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;load_module&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;modules/ngx_pagespeed.so&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# enable pagespeed module on this server block
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;pagespeed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Needs to exist and be writable by nginx. Use tmpfs for best performance.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;pagespeed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;FileCachePath&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;/var/ngx_pagespeed_cache&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Ensure requests for pagespeed optimized resources go to the pagespeed handler
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# and no extraneous headers get set.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;~&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sr"&gt;&amp;#34;\.pagespeed\.([a-z]\.)?[a-z]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;2}\.[^.]{10}\.[^.]+&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;add_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;~&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sr"&gt;&amp;#34;^/pagespeed_static/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;~&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sr"&gt;&amp;#34;^/ngx_pagespeed_beacon$&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;pagespeed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;RewriteLevel&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;CoreFilters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"load_module modules/ngx_pagespeed.so;\n\n\n# enable pagespeed module on this server block\npagespeed on;\n\n# Needs to exist and be writable by nginx. Use tmpfs for best performance.\npagespeed FileCachePath /var/ngx_pagespeed_cache;\n\n# Ensure requests for pagespeed optimized resources go to the pagespeed handler\n# and no extraneous headers get set.\nlocation ~ \"\\.pagespeed\\.([a-z]\\.)?[a-z]{2}\\.[^.]{10}\\.[^.]+\" {\n add_header \"\" \"\";\n}\nlocation ~ \"^/pagespeed_static/\" { }\nlocation ~ \"^/ngx_pagespeed_beacon$\" { }\n\npagespeed RewriteLevel CoreFilters;\n","title":"nginx"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The last line (&lt;code&gt;pagespeed RewriteLevel CoreFilters;&lt;/code&gt;) specifies the enabled optimizations. It includes basic filters such as:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>